    "description": {
      "value": "Gecko pads are thin, clockwork devices shaped like palms, which can be strapped onto existing handwear or a creature's hands. When activated, they whir to life and improve your grip on surfaces, while slowly releasing a sticky substance stored within the device's surface to help you climb. The pads give you a climb Speed equal to your Speed as long as your hands are free.\n\nThe climb Speed lasts for 1 hour.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact"
